WEBVTT

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.350
Don't let it land on the ground!

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.020
Where is Karasu?!

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:42.180
Go around to the left!

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:44.690
Not again! It has a shield!

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:23.440
Karasu has gotten through!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.640
No... It's collapsing! Run for it, Karasu!

00:01:55.350 --> 00:01:57.600
Karasu!

00:03:13.050 --> 00:03:15.550
No! This is Mom's.

00:03:15.550 --> 00:03:19.010
Baron, you've put on
too much weight recently.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.260
Mom, breakfast is ready.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:24.940
Haruka, what time is it?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:28.440
It's past eight.
I'm going to school, okay?

00:03:28.440 --> 00:03:30.270
See you later!

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.150
Later...

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:45.710
That's a homeless spirit!

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:49.210
They wander around towns aimlessly
without even realizing they're dead.

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:51.920
- Listen! You mustn't speak...
- Morning.

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.670
...to that kind of ghost
under any circumstances.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:57.010
'Cause if you do, you'll get
pulled into the spirit world!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.140
Morning, Ai.

00:03:59.140 --> 00:04:01.010
Good morning, Haruka.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:03.100
They seem to be having a good time.

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.640
Miho's holding her own lecture
on supernatural phenomena.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:06.890
Oh, I see.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:11.320
Kyoko from Class 2 says she saw a ghost
in the alley behind the church.

00:04:11.320 --> 00:04:12.190
A ghost?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.490
Yeah. A ghost in a black coat.

00:04:14.490 --> 00:04:17.950
All right, everyone! The bell is ringing!

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:19.280
Take your seats, take your seats!

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:24.750
Let's talk about the summer
break after homeroom.

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:26.000
Yukie-Sensei!

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.750
Yes, Fujiwara-kun?

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.420
Let's go on a date
during summer break!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:34.800
I'm so sorry. My date schedule is
booked solid for the next 3 years.

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:36.130
That's impossible...

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:44.850
When returning home,
please watch out for cars...

00:04:45.350 --> 00:04:46.850
Outta the way, teacher!

00:04:46.850 --> 00:04:48.020
No running in the halls!

00:04:48.020 --> 00:04:49.930
Oh, yeah! Tomorrow night...

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.690
do you wanna all get together
to test our courage?

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:53.190
- Test our courage?
- That'd be great!

00:04:53.190 --> 00:04:54.310
We'll hunt for ghosts!

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.360
It's summer break,
so let's all go together!

00:04:58.610 --> 00:04:59.570
What do you say, Fujiwara?

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:00.360
Huh?

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:02.530
Let's all go out to test our courage.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.780
Test our courage?

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:06.330
No, we're going on a ghost hunt!

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.710
Man, you guys are childish.
You believe in ghosts?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:14.210
Things like ghosts don't exist.

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:16.420
It's scientifically impossible.

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.920
Isn't that right, Yuu?

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.800
I don't think so! There are
still things in this world...

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.680
that can't be explained by science!

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:26.010
I don't think so! There are
no such things as ghosts.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:28.730
Oh? Then let's make sure!

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:32.440
Then the decision is final.
You're coming with us, Fujiwara.

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:35.150
Why? Why do I gotta go?

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:37.480
Don't tell me you're AFRAID of ghosts...

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.570
I... I'm not afraid
of ghosts. Right, Yuu?

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.780
I have to go to cram school,
so I can't come.

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.490
Yuu...

00:05:45.950 --> 00:05:48.290
Yuu, wait up a minute.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:49.870
You're acting weird.

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:54.960
You forgot, haven't you?

00:05:57.210 --> 00:06:00.130
Man, Yuu doesn't hang
out with us much recently.

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:03.220
He can't help it. He's studying
for middle-school entrance exams.

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.760
Yuu?

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.310
How long?

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:13.020
How long do I have to stay here?

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.200
Uchida-chan, did you know?

00:06:22.200 --> 00:06:23.910
Know what?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.830
That this is the first day
of summer break?

00:06:27.160 --> 00:06:31.790
Summer break? I haven't had
a vacation in five years.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.630
It's appeared again.

00:06:36.630 --> 00:06:38.630
Maybe you're picking up noise?

00:06:38.630 --> 00:06:40.970
Don't act like you know
what you're talking about.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.840
How will you report this to HQ?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:47.180
They won't give me the time of day
with this pitiful amount of data.

00:06:47.180 --> 00:06:50.270
Then I guess you'll have
to work harder, Uchida-chan.

00:06:50.270 --> 00:06:52.600
You're the last person
I want lecturing me about work.

00:06:52.600 --> 00:06:55.270
Also, please do your smoking outside.

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:58.320
Oh, shoot! Look at the time! Bye!

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.150
Go get 'im, Haruka!

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:01.690
I will!

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:04.610
Summer break, huh?

00:07:04.610 --> 00:07:06.160
Huh?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:10.910
Yuu?

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:12.410
Yeah?

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:16.630
Do you know that
summer school starts today?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.540
Yes.

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:22.670
I want you to concentrate on
your studies during the summer break.

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.180
I know.

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:27.430
Yuu?

00:07:29.180 --> 00:07:31.310
I know you can do it.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.350
Yuu?

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:40.520
Maybe you should stop...

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.900
...seeing your friends from school.

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.160
Testing your courage?

00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:51.410
We're doing it tomorrow night.
It's okay, right?

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.030
Just because it's summer break, you
shouldn't just spend your time goofing off.

00:07:55.030 --> 00:07:58.710
But I am working!
I made this lunch, didn't I?

00:07:58.710 --> 00:08:00.290
This is slightly uncooked.

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:04.220
It's al dente! If you have
a problem with it, you make lunch!

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:06.800
But you promised to do all the cooking...

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:09.430
until I finish my manuscript.

00:08:09.430 --> 00:08:11.550
So stop complaining.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:15.430
It's hard for a single mother
to raise a kid all on her own.

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.940
Dad's paying you
child support, isn't he?

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.440
Hey...

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:21.400
Even I know that.

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:24.190
I'm gonna be in middle school
next year, you know.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:26.740
Are you saying that mothers shouldn't
be working at all?!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.450
That's not what I meant.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:32.780
There's no use spending all your time
creating children's books that don't sell.

00:08:32.780 --> 00:08:35.080
Please don't say that.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.180
Oh, no. I dozed off.

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.190
Yuu!

00:09:06.610 --> 00:09:09.700
Studying so late?
You're really working hard.

00:09:10.450 --> 00:09:12.030
What do you want?

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:19.330
Why were you waiting in
front of the cram school?

00:09:19.330 --> 00:09:20.960
'Cause I had nothing better to do.

00:09:21.710 --> 00:09:25.130
You'll get busted if you walk
around this late at night.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:29.220
If you're worried about stuff like that,
then don't run away from home.

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.550
You're the one who
came up with the idea!

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:35.060
Just because you want to go
to your dad's place in Tokyo...

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.430
Yuu...

00:09:37.850 --> 00:09:39.810
Wanna run away from home?

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.850
Let's go to Tokyo together.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.570
I was having a fight
with Mom when I said that.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:50.150
My parents are divorced
and it's kind of complicated.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:51.240
Liar.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:53.410
I was an idiot to take you seriously.

00:09:53.410 --> 00:09:54.150
Yuu?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:56.820
Wait a second, Yuu!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.660
Forget it. Go home!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:00.830
I wasn't really lying.

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:03.790
You should think about it before
you actually run away from home.

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:07.840
I know that. Even if I did run away...

00:10:07.840 --> 00:10:10.760
I'd just be found and taken back
before I could get anywhere.

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.100
I know that, but...

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.680
I'll never get out of this town.

00:10:21.230 --> 00:10:23.230
I'm gonna be here forever.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:25.980
That's not true.

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:28.810
Once you're an adult, you'll
be able to go anywhere you want.

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.570
How come I'm not an adult?

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:36.200
Yuu?

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.370
I hate being a kid.

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:42.580
I want to grow up as soon as possible...

00:10:45.420 --> 00:10:46.620
Yuu?

00:10:51.220 --> 00:10:54.430
I think I'm going crazy.

00:10:57.220 --> 00:10:57.970
Yuu?

00:11:12.070 --> 00:11:13.650
Yuu?

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.450
Blue snow?

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.060
It's him.

00:12:02.540 --> 00:12:04.710
Dragon Torque.

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:53.500
He vanished.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.050
Hey, did you know?

00:12:57.050 --> 00:12:57.800
Know what?

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.840
I got mail from Saeko.
She said that the other night...

00:13:00.840 --> 00:13:03.850
a headless spirit appeared
in the shopping district.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:04.380
Spirit?

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.980
Yeah, and she said he
was wearing a black cape.

00:13:06.980 --> 00:13:08.520
A black cape...

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.020
I've seen him.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.930
You know, the spirit
wearing a black cape.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.480
What?!

00:13:15.480 --> 00:13:18.110
Wait! When? Where?

00:13:18.110 --> 00:13:19.450
Who cares?

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.620
I do! Tell me!

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.700
Hey, young ladies!

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:27.200
Do you girls live around here?

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:31.160
I'm checking on something...

00:13:31.880 --> 00:13:33.910
I was wondering if you'd help me out.

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.550
Oh, I'll treat you to juice
for your trouble. Canned juice.

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:40.130
I totally forgot!
We gotta hurry, Haruka!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.890
Huh? What is it, Ai?!

00:13:43.380 --> 00:13:45.060
What the?

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:48.020
Oh, well.

00:13:48.020 --> 00:13:50.140
That was definitely a pervert!

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:53.770
Come on, don't you think so?
Let's call the cops!

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:57.360
Don't worry. He acts shady...

00:13:57.360 --> 00:13:58.900
but he's okay.

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:05.490
Hi, Kooriyama here.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:09.370
Hey, Uchida-chan.
How are things over there?

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:14.130
Looks like the observation satellite
data analysis is complete in Tokyo.

00:14:14.130 --> 00:14:15.170
And?

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:18.170
It's definite.
They confirmed the irregularity.

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:21.050
So we'll be here for a while.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:23.590
Pretty much.

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.180
What do we do now?

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:28.850
I'm trying to come up with something
on the mountain top right now.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:56.630
I'm going to cram school.

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:58.170
Take care.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:04.930
I know that this courage test
stuff sounds stupid...

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:07.050
but I guess we could give it a shot.

00:15:07.050 --> 00:15:08.640
Isami...

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.270
You're scared, aren't you?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:11.890
N-Not at all.

00:15:12.230 --> 00:15:13.810
Hey, he's here!

00:15:13.810 --> 00:15:15.060
Yuu's with him.

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.110
They look kind of happy about it.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:26.870
I'm positive we'll see one. I can tell.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:28.620
How can I describe it?

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:31.700
I can feel the opening of my pores.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.710
You know...

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:39.330
The path is kind of dangerous,
so maybe we should turn back?

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:41.920
What's this? Are you a coward, Fujiwara?

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.470
H-Hey...

00:15:43.470 --> 00:15:45.970
C'mon, hurry up! Let's go!

00:15:47.180 --> 00:15:48.800
Mukai...

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.100
I bet that she doesn't
believe in ghosts at all.

00:15:53.480 --> 00:15:57.520
What'cha doing? Come on over!

00:15:57.980 --> 00:15:59.230
What is it?

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:00.360
I thought I saw a light.

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:01.980
Hey, cut it out!

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.740
What's the matter?

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:05.990
I saw some kind of light!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:07.950
What?! No way!

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:11.320
I bet it's a will-o'-the-wisp!
You saw a will-o'-the-wisp flying!

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.700
Will-o'-the-wisp?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.250
That's impossible!

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.950
Huh? Oh, the will-o'-the-wisp!

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.340
- This is bad.
- What's wrong?

00:16:30.430 --> 00:16:31.970
Ma'am.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.690
It's not too late.
Go to the cram school now!

00:16:38.650 --> 00:16:41.890
- I can't believe you would...
- Hey, wait a minute, ma'am.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:47.150
This is what you get
for seeing these children!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.820
<i>Coordinate fix complete.</i>

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.280
<i>Countdown.</i>

00:17:27.060 --> 00:17:29.360
That kinda took the fun out of it.

00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:33.910
Don't be like that!
You have to wish hard in your head.

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:35.950
Wish hard to meet a ghost!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.080
Is that how you do it?

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.200
That's right.
All right now, everybody wish!

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:43.000
Mr. Ghost, Mr. Ghost,
please come out! Pretty please!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.250
I think it's probably
a little different.

00:17:46.050 --> 00:17:47.340
Worried about Goto?

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:50.130
Huh? It-It's not like that...

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:53.800
Yeesh. Your feelings are always
written on your face, Haruka.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.390
What?

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:03.970
I got a call from the cram school
saying that you hadn't arrived.

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:09.650
Walking around so late at night with
just kids without adult supervision...

00:18:10.740 --> 00:18:12.780
I also saw Haruka-chan.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.990
Her mother is too ignorant
about her own child!

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:18.580
I...

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.160
I'm...

00:18:22.170 --> 00:18:24.080
...going crazy.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:27.920
Stop the car.

00:18:28.210 --> 00:18:30.220
Stop the car!

00:18:32.880 --> 00:18:33.970
Snow?

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.470
Blue snow.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:40.390
What's the matter, Haruka?

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:42.520
There's snow. Blue snow.

00:18:42.520 --> 00:18:44.190
Huh? Snow?!

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:47.860
There's no snow in the middle of summer.

00:18:47.860 --> 00:18:49.360
Ai...

00:18:52.990 --> 00:18:55.370
Mukai-san, haven't you had enough?

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:57.910
No! I'm not going home until I see one!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:01.080
I've gotten hungry.
We should head back soon.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.530
I can't see.

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.130
I can't see!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:09.710
Huh? Are the batteries dead?

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:11.300
Mukai?

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.670
That. Over there.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.180
Wh-What?

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:22.930
It's a shadow.
It's the shadow from a tree.

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:30.150
What's wrong, Miho?

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:31.280
We got one.

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:33.240
Huh? Got one what?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.220
Im-Im-Im-Impossible... That's impossible.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:05.730
Im-Im-Im-Impossible...

00:20:05.730 --> 00:20:07.150
That's impossible!

00:20:07.770 --> 00:20:09.770
What's wrong, Miho?

00:20:09.770 --> 00:20:10.520
Miho?

00:20:10.520 --> 00:20:12.110
R-Run, Haruka!

00:20:12.110 --> 00:20:12.480
Huh?

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:13.780
Hurry!

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.110
<i>One bird has disappeared.</i>

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.480
<i>Seven birds remain.</i>

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:27.960
A high-density Reizu reaction.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:30.290
It's impossible!

00:20:30.290 --> 00:20:33.050
Ghosts aren't supposed to have legs?!

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:35.050
That is definitely a ghost!

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:37.630
We actually saw a ghost!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.000
Don't be happy!

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:42.090
- Ai, that isn't a ghost.
- What?

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.590
It's too strange.

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.730
He can't help being strange!
He's a ghost!

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:54.140
It's coming this way!

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:56.570
A bird?

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:57.650
We have to get away.

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.780
What's wrong?!

00:20:58.780 --> 00:21:00.530
Hurry... Guys, hurry!

00:21:01.160 --> 00:21:03.410
